{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1785560148484,"level":"log","data":["{\"score\": 7, \"status\": \"good\", \"strengths\": [\"Solid academic background in Digital Solutions and Technology with focus on data structures, algorithms, and computer networks.\", \"Hands‑on experience developing a full‑cycle PHP/MySQL inventory management system, including user authentication, real‑time stock updates, and role‑based access control.\", \"Proficient in core web development stack: PHP, Java, JavaScript, HTML5, CSS3, and MySQL.\", \"Familiarity with version control (Git/GitHub) and development environments (VS Code, NetBeans).\", \"Demonstrated ability to design business plans and infographics, showing communication and analytical skills.\"], \"suggestions\": [\"Add clear dates for education and any internships or job positions to show career progression.\", \"Provide concrete results from the Mouse Master Inventory System (e.g., number of users, efficiency gains).\", \"Highlight any additional technologies or frameworks used (e.g., Laravel, Spring, React, Docker) to demonstrate broader skill set.\", \"Include relevant certifications (e.g., PHP, Java, AWS, Docker) to validate expertise.\", \"Detail specific teamwork experiences, such as Agile sprints, code reviews, or leadership roles, to strengthen soft‑skill claims.\", \"Improve formatting and proofread the CV to remove garbled characters and ensure consistent language (Thai/English).\", \"Add a portfolio link or GitHub repositories with live demos to showcase code quality.\"], \"weaknesses\": [\"Unclear or missing timeline for education and work experience, making it hard to assess recency of skills.\", \"Limited evidence of advanced Java usage; most experience appears to be in PHP.\", \"No specific metrics or outcomes from the inventory system project (e.g., user adoption, performance improvements).\", \"Lack of mention of modern development practices such as RESTful APIs, microservices, CI/CD, or cloud platforms.\", \"No explicit certification or training records, and limited demonstration of soft‑skill examples beyond generic teamwork.\"]}"]}
