{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1785560798169,"level":"log","data":["{\"score\": 75, \"status\": \"good\", \"strengths\": [\"Proficient in PHP, Java, JavaScript, HTML5, and CSS3\", \"Experience building full-stack web applications with MySQL\", \"Demonstrated ability to design relational database schemas and implement role‑based access control\", \"Strong academic foundation in Digital Solutions and Technology with focus on data structures, algorithms, and computer networks\", \"Real‑world project experience developing an inventory management system, showing end‑to‑end development and system optimization\", \"Familiarity with version control (Git) and development tools (VS Code, NetBeans)\", \"Solid problem‑solving and teamwork abilities\"], \"suggestions\": [\"Expand portfolio with projects using modern full‑stack technologies (e.g., React, Node.js, Docker, AWS) to broaden skill set\", \"Contribute to open‑source projects or participate in hackathons to gain collaborative experience and showcase code quality\", \"Obtain relevant certifications (e.g., PHP, Java, AWS Certified Developer) to validate expertise\", \"Detail testing frameworks, CI/CD pipelines, and code review practices to highlight software engineering maturity\", \"Improve CV clarity by fixing formatting, using consistent bullet points, and quantifying achievements (e.g., performance gains, user adoption)\", \"Develop soft skills such as technical writing, presentation, and stakeholder communication to enhance teamwork and leadership potential\", \"Learn at least one modern front‑end framework and backend micro‑service architecture to stay competitive in the job market\"], \"weaknesses\": [\"Limited professional experience; mainly one major project, lacking exposure to larger or more complex systems\", \"No mention of modern front‑end frameworks (e.g., React, Angular, Vue) or advanced UI/UX practices\", \"No evidence of cloud platform, containerization, or CI/CD pipeline experience\", \"No explicit demonstration of software testing, quality assurance, or code review processes\", \"Unclear English proficiency and communication skills beyond the summary\", \"No certifications or additional formal training beyond the degree\", \"CV formatting issues (broken characters) that affect readability\"]}"]}
