{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1786071709014,"level":"log","data":["{\"analysis\": {\"score\": 65, \"status\": \"Average\", \"strengths\": [\"Solid academic background in digital solutions and technology\", \"Practical experience building a full‑stack inventory system with PHP, MySQL, JavaScript\", \"Familiarity with multiple languages (PHP, Java, JavaScript) and web technologies\", \"Knowledge of database design, user role management, and real‑time data handling\", \"Demonstrates initiative to learn new technologies\", \"Shows ability to create business plans and infographics\"], \"suggestions\": [\"Clean up CV layout, fix formatting, and ensure consistent language and clear headings\", \"Include any internships, part‑time jobs, or freelance work to show real‑world experience\", \"Add measurable results for the inventory system (e.g., performance gains, user count)\", \"Expand skills with frameworks like Laravel or Spring, cloud platforms, Docker, and CI/CD tools\", \"Detail version control practices, testing methods, and deployment pipelines\", \"Revise the professional summary to be concise, error‑free, and focused on key strengths and career goals\", \"Add a portfolio link with live demos or code samples to showcase the project\"], \"weaknesses\": [\"Messy formatting and broken characters reduce professionalism\", \"Limited professional experience; only a student project is highlighted\", \"No quantifiable achievements or metrics for the project\", \"Skill list lacks modern frameworks, cloud services, and DevOps tools\", \"No mention of version control workflow, testing, or CI/CD practices\", \"Vague, error‑prone professional summary\"]}, \"questions\": {\"questions\": [\"Can you describe your experience developing the Mouse Master Inventory System, focusing on the PHP/MySQL architecture and user role management features?\", \"How did you implement real-time stock management in the inventory system, and what technologies or design patterns did you use?\", \"In your Business Plan & Infographic project for agricultural products, what steps did you take to analyze market feasibility and ROI?\", \"Which data structures and algorithms from your university studies have been most valuable in your software development work, and can you give an example?\", \"How do you stay updated with new technologies and ensure best practices while developing web applications using PHP, Java, and JavaScript?\"]}}"]}
