{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1786071852741,"level":"log","data":["{\"analysis\": {\"score\": 45, \"status\": \"needs improvement\", \"strengths\": [\"Relevant degree in Digital Solutions and Technology\", \"Solid technical stack: PHP, Java, JavaScript, HTML5, CSS3, MySQL\", \"Hands‑on project experience building a full‑stack inventory system\", \"Demonstrated ability to design database schemas and manage user roles\", \"Familiarity with version control (Git) and development tools (VS Code, NetBeans)\", \"Shows willingness to learn new technologies\"], \"suggestions\": [\"Clean up the CV layout: use consistent fonts, proper headings, and correct characters.\", \"Provide exact dates (month/year) for education, projects, and any work experience.\", \"Add quantifiable results (e.g., number of users, performance improvements, reduction in processing time).\", \"Rewrite the professional summary to be concise, error‑free, and highlight key strengths.\", \"Include any certifications (e.g., PHP, Java, SQL) and language proficiency (Thai, English).\", \"Expand the experience section with more roles, responsibilities, and outcomes, even if they are academic projects.\", \"Provide concrete examples of teamwork, problem‑solving, or leadership in bullet points.\", \"Add a link to a portfolio or live demo of the inventory system if available.\", \"Ensure all contact details (phone, email, GitHub) are fully visible and professional.\"], \"weaknesses\": [\"Incomplete and inconsistent formatting (garbled characters, missing sections)\", \"Lack of clear, chronological work experience and duration of roles\", \"No quantifiable achievements or measurable impact from projects\", \"Professional summary is vague and contains typographical errors\", \"Missing details on years of experience, certifications, and English proficiency\", \"Limited description of soft skills and teamwork examples\", \"Contact information is partially masked (phone number)\", \"No mention of any internships, freelance work, or additional relevant activities\"]}, \"questions\": {\"questions\": [\"Can you describe the architecture and key features of the Mouse Master Inventory System you developed, and explain how you implemented real-time stock management and user role permissions?\", \"What specific challenges did you encounter while integrating PHP with Java in the inventory system, and how did you resolve them to ensure system performance and maintainability?\", \"How did your coursework in data structures, algorithms, and computer networks at Khon Kaen University influence your approach to designing the database schema and optimizing queries in the MySQL backend of your projects?\", \"In the Business Plan & Infographic Design project, how did you translate technical feasibility and market analysis into an actionable digital strategy, and what tools or frameworks did you use for the infographic design?\", \"Given your experience with Git, VS Code, and Linux environments, can you walk us through your typical development workflow for a new web application, from repository setup to deployment, and how you ensure code quality and collaboration with teammates?\"]}}"]}
