{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1786073337742,"level":"log","data":["{\"analysis\": {\"score\": 6, \"status\": \"Junior Software Developer\", \"strengths\": [\"Proficient in PHP, Java, JavaScript, HTML5, CSS3, and MySQL\", \"Hands‑on experience developing a full‑cycle inventory management system\", \"Solid academic background in Digital Solutions and Technology\", \"Experience with database design, user role management, and real‑time data handling\", \"Familiarity with version control (Git) and development tools (VS Code, NetBeans)\", \"Strong problem‑solving and teamwork abilities\"], \"suggestions\": [\"Provide exact start/end dates for each role and project to clarify career timeline\", \"Add metrics (e.g., number of users, performance improvements, reduction in stock errors) to demonstrate impact\", \"Include additional projects or internships that showcase a broader technology stack\", \"List any relevant certifications (e.g., PHP, Java, AWS, etc.) and English proficiency level\", \"Highlight specific responsibilities such as leadership, code review, or mentoring if applicable\", \"Polish the CV layout for readability and ensure all sections are consistently formatted\"], \"weaknesses\": [\"Inconsistent formatting and missing contact details (phone number masked)\", \"Lack of clear dates for work experience and projects, making timeline unclear\", \"No quantifiable achievements or measurable impact from the inventory system\", \"Limited exposure to modern frameworks or cloud technologies\", \"No mention of English proficiency or other soft‑skill certifications\", \"No evidence of testing, CI/CD, or performance optimization practices\"]}, \"questions\": {\"questions\": [\"Can you describe your experience developing the Mouse Master Inventory System using PHP, MySQL, and Java, and highlight the key features you implemented?\", \"How did you design and implement user role management in the inventory system, and what challenges did you encounter?\", \"Which courses or projects during your Digital Solutions and Technology degree best prepared you for real‑world software development, and how did you apply that knowledge in your work?\", \"Among PHP, Java, and JavaScript, which language are you most proficient in, and can you provide an example of a complex problem you solved with it?\", \"How do you stay current with emerging web technologies and best practices, and what recent tool or technology have you adopted in your projects?\"]}}"]}
