{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1786074628272,"level":"log","data":["{\"analysis\": {\"score\": 68, \"status\": \"Good potential\", \"strengths\": [\"Solid foundation in PHP, Java, JavaScript, HTML5, CSS3, and MySQL\", \"Hands‑on experience building a full‑stack inventory management system (login, session, search, real‑time stock, role management)\", \"Academic background in Digital Solutions and Technology with focus on data structures, algorithms, and computer networks\", \"Demonstrated ability to design databases and implement user role management\", \"Familiarity with version control (Git) and development environments (VS Code, NetBeans, Linux)\", \"Strong problem‑solving and teamwork competencies\"], \"suggestions\": [\"Reformat the CV with clean headings, consistent language (preferably English), and clear chronological dates for education and experience\", \"Add a concise, targeted professional summary that highlights key achievements with metrics\", \"Detail the Mouse Master Inventory System: describe your specific role, technologies used, and measurable outcomes (e.g., performance improvements, user adoption)\", \"Include any additional projects, internships, freelance work, or part‑time positions that showcase real‑world software development\", \"List specific frameworks, libraries, and tools (e.g., Composer, Maven, GitHub Actions, Docker) to demonstrate depth of expertise\", \"Provide links to live demos or GitHub repositories with code samples for each major project\", \"Obtain relevant certifications (e.g., PHP, Java, AWS, Google Cloud) to strengthen credibility\", \"Ensure contact information and online profiles are prominently placed and up‑to‑date\"], \"weaknesses\": [\"CV layout is cluttered, mixes Thai and English, and contains placeholder text, reducing readability\", \"Limited quantitative achievements or measurable impact from projects\", \"No clear employment timeline; only a student‑project description, lacking professional work experience\", \"Missing mention of modern frameworks, tools, or practices (e.g., Laravel, Spring, Docker, CI/CD pipelines)\", \"No certifications, licenses, or additional training beyond the degree\", \"Bullet points in skills section are repetitive and incomplete, obscuring true competency levels\", \"Contact details and online profiles are present but not prominently displayed\"]}, \"questions\": {\"questions\": [\"Can you describe the Mouse Master Inventory System project you developed, including the specific PHP and Java features you implemented for login session management, real‑time stock updates, and user role handling?\", \"How did you design and optimize the MySQL database schema for the inventory system, and what strategies did you use to ensure data integrity and efficient product search with filtering?\", \"In what ways did your academic coursework in data structures, algorithms, and computer networks contribute to solving challenges you encountered while building the inventory management system?\", \"Which version control and development tools (e.g., Git, VS Code, NetBeans) did you use throughout the project, and how did they impact your workflow and collaboration with teammates?\", \"Given your interest in learning new technologies, can you share an example of a recent technology or framework you have started to explore that could improve future web application development?\"]}}"]}
