{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1786074848157,"level":"log","data":["{\"analysis\": {\"score\": 4, \"status\": \"Needs Improvement\", \"strengths\": [\"Relevant degree in Digital Solutions and Technology from a reputable university\", \"Hands‑on experience developing web applications using PHP, Java, JavaScript, HTML5, and CSS3\", \"Proven project experience with a full‑stack inventory system (Mouse Master) including login, search, real‑time stock management, and user role design\", \"Knowledge of database design, SQL (MySQL), and user permission management\", \"Familiarity with version control (Git/GitHub) and development environments (VS Code, NetBeans, Linux)\", \"Demonstrated ability to learn new technologies and apply them in projects\"], \"suggestions\": [\"Reformat the CV using a clean, consistent layout; ensure all characters are correctly encoded and remove stray symbols\", \"Provide exact dates for education, training, and current position, and clarify the scope of the current role with bullet‑point responsibilities and achievements\", \"Add measurable outcomes to project descriptions (e.g., performance improvements, user adoption numbers, error reduction)\", \"Include any additional relevant projects, internships, or work experience to demonstrate breadth and career progression\", \"List certifications (e.g., PHP, Java, AWS, etc.) and specify language proficiency, especially English\", \"Rewrite the professional summary to concisely highlight years of experience, core competencies, and career objective\", \"Organize the skills section into clear categories (Programming Languages, Tools & Frameworks, Core Competencies) and prioritize the most relevant for the target job\", \"Provide a complete contact section with a professional email, phone number, and links to GitHub/LinkedIn portfolio\"], \"weaknesses\": [\"Malformed formatting with missing characters and inconsistent Thai/English text, making readability difficult\", \"Vague professional summary containing grammatical errors and lacking concrete details about experience or goals\", \"No clear timeline of work history; only a current title without described responsibilities or achievements\", \"No quantifiable results or impact metrics for the listed project\", \"Limited description of additional projects, internships, or full‑time employment beyond the single inventory system\", \"Missing information on graduation year, honors, or any certifications\", \"No mention of English proficiency or other soft skills\", \"Contact details partially masked (phone number) and lacking a professional LinkedIn or portfolio link\"]}, \"questions\": {\"questions\": [\"Can you describe the Mouse Master Inventory System project, your specific contributions, and the technical challenges you faced while implementing user role management and real-time stock updates?\", \"How did you apply data structures and algorithms knowledge from your university studies in your software development work, particularly in the inventory system?\", \"Which PHP frameworks or Java technologies have you used, and can you give an example of how you optimized performance in a web application you built?\", \"Considering your experience with Git and GitHub, how do you manage version control for collaborative projects, and what strategies do you use for code review and continuous integration?\", \"As a student passionate about digital technology, what new technologies or tools have you recently learned or plan to explore to improve your software development capabilities?\"]}}"]}
