{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1786083030362,"level":"log","data":["{\"analysis\": {\"score\": 70, \"status\": \"Junior Software Developer\", \"strengths\": [\"Solid foundation in PHP, Java, JavaScript, HTML5, CSS3, and MySQL\", \"Academic background in Digital Solutions and Technology (B.Sc.) with coursework in data structures, algorithms, and computer networks\", \"Hands‑on project experience developing a full‑stack inventory management system (Mouse Master) including login management, real‑time stock updates, and user role controls\", \"Demonstrated ability to design database schemas and implement user authentication/authorization\", \"Interest in learning new technologies and continuously improving skills\"], \"suggestions\": [\"Clean up formatting: remove stray characters, use consistent bullet points, and ensure clear section headings\", \"Add precise dates for education, employment, and each project to show duration and recency\", \"Include measurable results (e.g., \\\"Reduced product search time by 30%\\\" or \\\"Handled 500+ concurrent users\\\")\", \"Provide full contact details including a professional email, phone number, and a LinkedIn profile link\", \"List any relevant certifications (e.g., PHP, Java, AWS) or short courses to strengthen credibility\", \"Expand on teamwork and problem‑solving with specific examples (e.g., \\\"Collaborated with a 4‑member team to deliver the inventory system in 8 weeks\\\")\", \"Consider adding a concise professional summary that highlights years of experience and key competencies\"], \"weaknesses\": [\"CV contains garbled characters and inconsistent formatting, reducing readability\", \"No clear timeline (dates) for education, work experience, or project duration\", \"Lacks quantifiable achievements or measurable impact of projects (e.g., user count, performance improvements)\", \"Contact information is incomplete (phone number masked, missing professional LinkedIn profile)\", \"No mention of certifications, internships, or additional training beyond the degree\", \"Limited description of soft skills and teamwork beyond generic statements\"]}, \"questions\": {\"questions\": [\"Can you describe the Mouse Master Inventory System project, its main features, and your specific role in its development?\", \"How did you implement user role management and real-time stock management in the inventory system, and what technologies did you use?\", \"Which courses or projects during your Digital Solutions and Technology studies best prepared you for applying data structures and algorithms in real-world software development?\", \"What version control and collaboration tools have you used, and can you give an example of how you used Git/GitHub to manage a project's codebase?\", \"When starting a new web application, how do you decide which programming language or technology stack (e.g., PHP, Java, JavaScript) to use?\"]}}"]}
