duct selection or service, and could you provide a specific example where your approach resolved the issue?\", \"What inventory management techniques or best practices have you implemented to ensure accuracy and minimize errors in stock data?\", \"Given your current studies in Digital Solutions and Technology, how do you envision applying new technologies to enhance automotive parts sales, service, or inventory processes?\", \"Based on your experience, what do you consider the most important strengths and areas for development for succeeding in a parts sales and service position?\"]}}"]}
