{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1786152572195,"level":"log","data":["{\"analysis\": {\"score\": 68, \"status\": \"Average\", \"strengths\": [\"Solid foundation in PHP, Java, JavaScript, HTML5, CSS3, and MySQL\", \"Academic background in Digital Solutions and Technology with focus on data structures, algorithms, and computer networks\", \"Hands‑on project experience building a full‑cycle inventory management system (login, session management, search, real‑time stock, role‑based access)\", \"Demonstrated ability to design database schemas and manage user permissions\", \"Familiarity with version control (Git/GitHub) and development tools (VS Code, NetBeans)\", \"Strong problem‑solving and teamwork skills\"], \"suggestions\": [\"Standardize the CV format: use clear headings, consistent dates, and uniform language (Thai or English) without stray characters.\", \"Add precise start and end dates for each position, including any internships or freelance work.\", \"Include measurable results (e.g., improved search speed by X%, reduced inventory errors by Y%).\", \"Highlight any additional technologies, tools, or methodologies used (e.g., Composer, Docker, Agile/Scrum).\", \"Add a concise English professional summary to make the CV accessible to international recruiters.\", \"Consider obtaining relevant certifications (e.g., PHP Certified Developer, Java SE, AWS) to strengthen the profile.\", \"Expand the project section with more detail on your role, technologies, and outcomes, and include a link to a live demo or repository if available.\"], \"weaknesses\": [\"Unclear and inconsistent timeline (current position date ambiguous, missing previous work history)\", \"CV formatting issues (mixed Thai/English characters, incomplete sections, stray symbols)\", \"Lack of quantifiable achievements or measurable impact from projects\", \"Limited exposure to modern frameworks or technologies (e.g., Laravel, Spring, React)\", \"No mention of certifications, training, or continuous learning activities\", \"Missing detailed description of responsibilities and contributions in the current role\"]}, \"questions\": {\"questions\": [\"Can you describe the Mouse Master Inventory System project, your specific role, and the PHP/JavaScript features you implemented for real-time stock management and user role management?\", \"How did you design the database schema for the inventory system, and which normalization or optimization techniques did you apply?\", \"Which courses or projects during your Digital Solutions and Technology studies best prepared you for software development, and how have you applied those concepts in your professional work?\", \"What strategies do you use to stay current with new technologies and best practices in PHP, Java, and full‑stack development?\", \"Can you discuss a challenging bug or performance issue you encountered in the inventory system and the steps you took to diagnose and resolve it?\"]}}"]}
