{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1786152608185,"level":"log","data":["{\"analysis\": {\"score\": 65, \"status\": \"Average\", \"strengths\": [\"Clear technical stack: PHP, Java, JavaScript, HTML5, CSS3, MySQL\", \"Relevant academic background in Digital Solutions and Technology\", \"Practical project experience building a full‑stack inventory system with login, search, real‑time stock, and role management\", \"Demonstrated ability to design database structures and manage user roles\", \"Shows initiative to learn new technologies and improve system performance\"], \"suggestions\": [\"Clean up the CV layout, fix language encoding, and use consistent formatting\", \"Add a detailed work history section, including internships, freelance work, or full‑time roles with dates and responsibilities\", \"Include measurable results for each project (e.g., \\\"Reduced product search time by 30%\\\" or \\\"Handled 500+ concurrent users\\\")\", \"List any relevant certifications (e.g., PHP, Java, AWS, etc.) and continuous learning activities\", \"Provide a portfolio link or GitHub repositories with live demos to showcase code quality\", \"Expand the core competencies section with specific, non‑placeholder bullet points highlighting key skills and achievements\"], \"weaknesses\": [\"Messy formatting and broken characters hinder readability\", \"Lacks concrete work experience; appears limited to academic/projects only\", \"No quantifiable achievements or metrics (e.g., performance improvements, user numbers)\", \"Missing professional certifications or training details\", \"Bullet points for core competencies are empty/placeholder\", \"No clear indication of years of experience or career progression\"]}, \"questions\": {\"questions\": [\"Can you walk us through the Mouse Master Inventory System project, detailing the technologies used, your specific contributions, and the key features you implemented such as login management, real‑time stock updates, and user role handling?\", \"How did your academic training in Digital Solutions and Technology, especially courses on data structures, algorithms, and computer networks, shape your approach to designing and optimizing the software systems you have built?\", \"Describe a project where you implemented user role management and real‑time inventory tracking. What strategies did you employ to ensure data security, scalability, and performance in that system?\", \"Given your proficiency in PHP, Java, and JavaScript, how do you determine which programming language or technology stack is most appropriate for a new project’s requirements and constraints?\", \"Share an example of a challenging technical problem or bug you encountered during a development project. What steps did you take to diagnose the issue and what was the final solution?\"]}}"]}
