{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1786152644655,"level":"log","data":["{\"analysis\": {\"score\": 45, \"status\": \"Under Review\", \"strengths\": [\"Good communication skills and customer service orientation\", \"Detail-oriented approach to inventory management\", \"Hands-on experience developing an inventory management system (Mouse Master Inventory) in 2020\", \"Currently studying Digital Solutions and Technology, showing willingness to learn new technologies\", \"Basic computer and data management skills\"], \"suggestions\": [\"Proofread and correct all spelling and grammar errors; consider using a professional editor or native speaker\", \"Rewrite the CV with a clear, concise professional summary that aligns with the tire shop sales/service position\", \"Provide a detailed work experience section, listing each role, dates, specific duties, and measurable results (e.g., % increase in sales, reduction in inventory errors)\", \"Highlight any direct experience in automotive parts, tire sales, or customer service, even if informal or volunteer work\", \"Add relevant certifications or training (e.g., automotive service courses, sales training, inventory management certifications)\", \"Specify technical skills such as the inventory software used, POS systems, or any other automotive‑related tools\", \"Ensure all contact details are complete and correctly formatted\"], \"weaknesses\": [\"Numerous spelling, grammar, and formatting errors that reduce readability\", \"Vague and generic description of responsibilities without concrete achievements or metrics\", \"Unclear timeline of work experience; no specific years of relevant experience in a tire shop\", \"Lack of clear, job‑specific summary or objective tailored to the sales and service role\", \"Missing certifications, training, or relevant technical qualifications for automotive sales/service\", \"Incomplete contact information (phone number masked)\"]}, \"questions\": {\"questions\": [\"Can you describe the Mouse Master Inventory system you developed in March 2020, its main features, and how it improved inventory management for automotive parts?\", \"How do you ensure accuracy and minimize errors when managing stock levels and handling data entry in a high‑volume automotive parts warehouse?\", \"What specific techniques or processes have you used to handle customer complaints and turn them into positive outcomes in a sales environment?\", \"How have you leveraged your Digital Solutions and Technology degree to stay updated with new automotive technologies and integrate them into your inventory or sales processes?\", \"In your previous roles, how did you balance strict daily delivery deadlines with maintaining high‑quality customer service and product knowledge?\"]}}"]}
