{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1786157063553,"level":"log","data":["{\"analysis\": {\"score\": 6, \"status\": \"Junior Software Developer\", \"strengths\": [\"Solid foundation in PHP, Java, JavaScript, HTML5, CSS3, and MySQL\", \"Academic background in Digital Solutions and Technology with coursework in data structures, algorithms, and computer networks\", \"Hands‑on project experience building a full‑stack inventory management system (Mouse Master Inventory System)\", \"Demonstrated ability to design database schemas and implement user role management\", \"Shows initiative to learn new technologies and improve system performance\"], \"suggestions\": [\"Rewrite the professional summary to clearly highlight years of experience, key competencies, and career objectives\", \"Add specific metrics or outcomes for the inventory system project (e.g., user adoption rate, performance improvements, reduced processing time)\", \"Specify the length of experience (e.g., “2 years as a Software Developer”) and include any internships or full‑time roles\", \"Provide a complete and professional contact section (full phone number, email, LinkedIn/GitHub links)\", \"Include any relevant certifications (e.g., PHP Certified Developer, Java SE, AWS, etc.) and continuous learning activities\", \"Detail the technologies and tools used in each project (e.g., Laravel, Spring Boot, Docker, CI/CD pipelines) to demonstrate depth of knowledge\", \"Highlight soft skills with concrete examples (team collaboration, problem‑solving, agile methodology)\", \"Clean up formatting, remove duplicate bullet points, and ensure consistent use of bullet symbols and spacing\", \"Tailor the CV for each job application by emphasizing the most relevant skills and experiences for the target role\"], \"weaknesses\": [\"Professional summary is garbled and lacks clarity, making it hard to gauge overall fit\", \"Limited concrete evidence of professional work experience beyond a single academic‑type project\", \"No quantifiable achievements or measurable impact from the listed projects\", \"Unclear duration of experience (e.g., how many years in the field) and no detailed timeline\", \"Contact information partially masked (phone number and email not fully visible)\", \"Missing mention of modern development frameworks, version‑control best practices, or relevant certifications\", \"Formatting issues and repetitive bullet points reduce readability\"]}, \"questions\": {\"questions\": [\"Can you describe the architecture and key features of the Mouse Master Inventory System you developed, and explain how you implemented user role management and real-time stock updates?\", \"What were the biggest technical challenges you faced while building the inventory system with PHP, MySQL, and JavaScript, and how did you overcome them?\", \"How did your academic projects, especially the Business Plan & Infographic Design for an agricultural product, contribute to your understanding of digital solution development and business analysis?\", \"In what ways have you applied your knowledge of data structures, algorithms, and computer networks in your software development work or studies?\", \"Which emerging technologies or tools are you currently exploring to improve web application development, and how do you plan to integrate them into future projects?\"]}}"]}
{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1786157063554,"level":"log","data":["{\"score\": 6, \"status\": \"Junior Software Developer\", \"strengths\": [\"Solid foundation in PHP, Java, JavaScript, HTML5, CSS3, and MySQL\", \"Academic background in Digital Solutions and Technology with coursework in data structures, algorithms, and computer networks\", \"Hands‑on project experience building a full‑stack inventory management system (Mouse Master Inventory System)\", \"Demonstrated ability to design database schemas and implement user role management\", \"Shows initiative to learn new technologies and improve system performance\"], \"suggestions\": [\"Rewrite the professional summary to clearly highlight years of experience, key competencies, and career objectives\", \"Add specific metrics or outcomes for the inventory system project (e.g., user adoption rate, performance improvements, reduced processing time)\", \"Specify the length of experience (e.g., “2 years as a Software Developer”) and include any internships or full‑time roles\", \"Provide a complete and professional contact section (full phone number, email, LinkedIn/GitHub links)\", \"Include any relevant certifications (e.g., PHP Certified Developer, Java SE, AWS, etc.) and continuous learning activities\", \"Detail the technologies and tools used in each project (e.g., Laravel, Spring Boot, Docker, CI/CD pipelines) to demonstrate depth of knowledge\", \"Highlight soft skills with concrete examples (team collaboration, problem‑solving, agile methodology)\", \"Clean up formatting, remove duplicate bullet points, and ensure consistent use of bullet symbols and spacing\", \"Tailor the CV for each job application by emphasizing the most relevant skills and experiences for the target role\"], \"weaknesses\": [\"Professional summary is garbled and lacks clarity, making it hard to gauge overall fit\", \"Limited concrete evidence of professional work experience beyond a single academic‑type project\", \"No quantifiable achieve