{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1787154621227,"level":"log","data":["INSERT DATA =","[{\"conversation\": \"[{\\\"sender\\\":\\\"ai\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"In your Mouse Master Inventory System, you used PHP, MySQL, CSS/JavaScript. Can you walk us through how you structured the frontend components and managed state without a modern framework like React or Vue?\\\"},{\\\"sender\\\":\\\"user\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"หฟก\\\"},{\\\"sender\\\":\\\"ai\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Your CV mentions you are a \\\\\\\"Lead Developer\\\\\\\" on the Mouse Master Inventory System. What specific frontend challenges did you face during that project, and how did you resolve them?\\\"},{\\\"sender\\\":\\\"user\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"ฟหกฟห\\\"},{\\\"sender\\\":\\\"ai\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"You have experience with JavaScript and CSS3. Could you give an example of a custom UI component you built from scratch and explain the design decisions behind it?\\\"},{\\\"sender\\\":\\\"user\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"ฟหกฟห\\\"},{\\\"sender\\\":\\\"ai\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"In the Digital Business Innovation Project, you conducted market research and created an infographic strategy. How did you translate those findings into a user-friendly frontend interface, and what tools did you use to prototype it?\\\"},{\\\"sender\\\":\\\"user\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"ฟหกฟห\\\"},{\\\"sender\\\":\\\"ai\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Your technical skills list Git/GitHub and VS Code. How do you structure your frontend codebase and workflow to ensure maintainability and collaboration with other developers?\\\"},{\\\"sender\\\":\\\"user\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"ฟหกฟห\\\"}]\", \"created_at\": \"2026-08-19T15:50:20.675927\", \"id\": 23, \"level\": \"Unqualified\", \"position\": \"Frontend Developer\", \"score\": 0, \"strengths\": \"[]\", \"suggestions\": \"[\\\"Prepare responses to common interview questions\\\",\\\"Practice speaking clearly and confidently\\\",\\\"Consider taking communication skills training\\\"]\", \"user_id\": \"64ff99fd-0c0f-461e-a199-0b0