{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1787154744437,"level":"log","data":["CV ANALYSIS =","{\"analysis\": {\"score\": 65, \"status\": \"Moderate Match\", \"strengths\": [\"Proficient in JavaScript, HTML5, CSS3\", \"Experience with full-stack development and database integration\", \"Demonstrated ability to lead a project and implement secure session management\"], \"suggestions\": [\"Gain hands-on experience with a popular front-end framework such as React or Vue.js\", \"Build a personal portfolio showcasing responsive, interactive UI components\", \"Participate in front-end focused open-source projects or hackathons to strengthen practical skills\"], \"weaknesses\": [\"No experience with modern front-end frameworks (React, Vue, Angular)\", \"Limited exposure to responsive design and advanced UI/UX practices\", \"Lacks portfolio of standalone front-end projects or contributions to open-source front-end code\"]}, \"position\": \"Frontend Developer\", \"questions\": {\"questions\": [\"In your Mouse Master Inventory System project, you used JavaScript for real-time product search. Can you walk us through how you implemented this feature and what libraries or vanilla techniques you used?\", \"Your CV lists both PHP and JavaScript as core programming languages. How do you decide which language to use for a particular frontend task, and can you give an example from a recent project?\", \"You mentioned using CSS/JavaScript for the inventory system. How did you ensure cross-browser compatibility and responsive design, and what tools did you use to test this?\", \"During the Digital Business Innovation Project, you conducted market research. How did you translate those findings into frontend design decisions, such as UI/UX improvements or feature prioritization?\", \"You have experience with Git/GitHub and VS Code. Can you describe your workflow for collaborating on a frontend codebase, including branching strategy, code reviews, and deployment processes?\"]}, \"success\": true}"]}
