{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1787155380808,"level":"log","data":["CV ANALYSIS =","{\"analysis\": {\"score\": 65, \"status\": \"Moderate Match\", \"strengths\": [\"Proficient in JavaScript, HTML5, CSS3\", \"Experience with full-stack development and database integration\", \"Demonstrated ability to lead a project and implement secure session management\"], \"suggestions\": [\"Gain hands-on experience with a popular front-end framework such as React or Vue.js\", \"Build a personal portfolio showcasing responsive, interactive UI components\", \"Participate in front-end focused open-source projects or hackathons to strengthen practical skills\"], \"weaknesses\": [\"No experience with modern front-end frameworks (React, Vue, Angular)\", \"Limited exposure to responsive design and advanced UI/UX practices\", \"Lacks portfolio of standalone front-end projects or contributions to open-source front-end code\"]}, \"position\": \"Frontend Developer\", \"questions\": {\"questions\": [\"In your Mouse Master Inventory System project, you used JavaScript for real-time product search. Can you walk us through how you implemented that feature and what libraries or vanilla techniques you used?\", \"Your CV lists PHP, Java, and JavaScript among your programming skills. As a Frontend Developer, how do you decide when to use JavaScript frameworks versus vanilla JS, and can you give an example from your recent work?\", \"You mentioned leading the Mouse Master Inventory System. What challenges did you face coordinating with backend developers, and how did you ensure the frontend met the API contracts?\", \"During your Digital Business Innovation Project, you conducted market research. How did you translate those findings into UI/UX decisions for the product, and what tools did you use to prototype those designs?\", \"Your technical skill set includes CSS3. Can you describe a time when you had to implement a responsive layout for a complex component, and what CSS techniques or preprocessors did you employ?\"]}, \"success\": true}"]}
