{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1787155608829,"level":"log","data":["CV ANALYSIS =","{\"analysis\": {\"score\": 68, \"status\": \"Moderate Match\", \"strengths\": [\"Strong PHP and MySQL skills\", \"Experience designing relational database schemas\", \"Lead developer role in a full‑stack inventory system\", \"Solid foundation in Java and SQL\"], \"suggestions\": [\"Gain hands‑on experience with a popular backend framework and build REST APIs\", \"Add unit testing and CI/CD practices to projects\", \"Pursue relevant certifications (e.g., Oracle Java SE, PHP Developer, MySQL Database Administrator)\", \"Expand portfolio with additional backend projects or contributions to open source\"], \"weaknesses\": [\"Limited exposure to modern backend frameworks (e.g., Spring, Node.js, Django)\", \"No demonstrated experience with RESTful APIs or microservices\", \"No certifications or formal training in backend development\", \"Project experience is limited to a single system\"]}, \"position\": \"Backend Developer\", \"questions\": {\"questions\": [\"In your Mouse Master Inventory System project, you mentioned implementing secure session management. Can you walk us through the authentication flow you designed and how you ensured session data was protected against common attacks such as session fixation or hijacking?\", \"Your CV lists both PHP and Java among your core programming languages. How have you decided which language to use for a particular backend task, and can you give an example from a recent project where you chose one over the other?\", \"The inventory system required real‑time product search. What database indexing or query optimization techniques did you employ in MySQL to achieve low latency, and how did you measure performance improvements?\", \"During your Digital Business Innovation Project you performed market research and cost‑benefit analysis. How did you translate those findings into technical requirements for the backend, and what data models did you design to support those requirements?\", \"You have experience using GitHub and VS Code. Can you describe a challenging merge conflict you resolved in a collaborative project, and what strategies you used to maintain code quality and project continuity?\"]}, \"success\": true}"]}
