{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1787155699978,"level":"log","data":["CV ANALYSIS =","{\"analysis\": {\"score\": 55, \"status\": \"Qualified\", \"strengths\": [\"Experience in developing an inventory management system (Mouse Master Inventory)\", \"Project management and system design experience\", \"Current studies in Digital Solutions and Technology\"], \"suggestions\": [\"Acquire and showcase backend programming skills (e.g., Java, Python, Node.js)\", \"Build additional backend projects (e.g., API services, database integration)\", \"Obtain relevant certifications (e.g., Oracle Java, AWS Certified Developer)\", \"Highlight specific backend responsibilities and technologies in future CVs\"], \"weaknesses\": [\"No demonstrated backend development skills (e.g., Java, Python, Node.js, SQL, REST APIs)\", \"Limited relevant work experience for a backend developer role\", \"No certifications or training in backend technologies\"]}, \"position\": \"Backend Developer\", \"questions\": {\"questions\": [\"Regarding your experience as a system developer for the Mouse Master Inventory project, can you describe the backend architecture you used and the technologies (e.g., database, server-side language) you chose?\", \"In your CV you mention improving inventory search speed. What specific performance optimization techniques did you implement on the backend, and how did you measure the improvement?\", \"You have a background in digital solutions and technology. How would you apply your knowledge of digital solutions to design a scalable API for a vehicle parts inventory system?\", \"Can you walk us through a challenging bug you encountered while developing the inventory system and explain how you diagnosed and resolved it?\", \"Your CV highlights attention to detail and data accuracy. How do you ensure data integrity and consistency in a backend system that handles inventory transactions?\"]}, \"success\": true}"]}
