{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1787206145372,"level":"log","data":["BACKEND RAW RESPONSE =","{\"success\":true,\"cv_id\":\"7acb5827-6bb7-4ae1-9a29-1c8de1fd3277\",\"is_passed\":false,\"position\":\"Frontend Developer\",\"analysis\":{\"score\":0,\"status\":\"Rejected\",\"strengths\":[],\"weaknesses\":[\"No relevant technical skills for frontend development.\",\"Lack of professional experience in software development.\",\"CV content is unprofessional and irrelevant to the job.\",\"Poor communication skills demonstrated through unprofessional email and attitude.\",\"Negative attitude towards work ethic (e.g., potential lateness, sleeping).\",\"Education is in an unrelated field (Sports Science).\",\"GPA is low.\",\"CV explicitly states it is a 'Bad Example' and highlights numerous flaws.\"],\"suggestions\":[\"Consider a career path more aligned with sports or physical activities.\",\"If interested in frontend development, pursue formal education or intensive training in programming languages (HTML, CSS, JavaScript), frameworks, and development tools.\",\"Develop a professional resume highlighting relevant skills and experiences.\",\"Improve work ethic and professional communication.\"]},\"questions\":{\"questions\":[\"Given your background in Sports Science and your stated passion for sports, how do you see your skills translating to a Frontend Developer role, and what specifically about frontend development interests you?\",\"Your CV mentions a tendency to be late due to watching late-night football. How would you ensure punctuality and commitment to your work schedule as a Frontend Developer, especially considering the collaborative nature of software development?\",\"You've listed skills like 'เตะบอลเก่งมาก' (very good at kicking a ball) and 'เชี่ยวชาญการเล่นวิ่งเปี้ยว' (expert at playing tag). While these demonstrate enthusiasm, how would you apply a problem-solving mindset and technical skills to actual frontend development tasks?\",\"Your experience as a football team captain involved managing a team that lost 5 consecutive matches but received a spirit award. Can you describe a situation where you faced a significant challenge or failure in a team setting and what you learned from it that could be applied to a development project?\",\"The CV highlights a GPA of 2.12 and an 'F' in Nutrition due to excessive 'หมูกระทะ' (BBQ pork). How do you approach learning new technical skills and ensuring you meet the required standards and deadlines in a professional development environment?\"]}}"]}
{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1787206256389,"level":"log","data":["BACKEND RAW RESPONSE =","{\"success\":true,\"cv_id\":\"81b2d3d4-bff9-4614-877d-b64fa4a420aa\",\"is_passed\":true,\"position\":\"Frontend Developer\",\"analysis\":{\"score\":78,\"status\":\"Strong Match\",\"strengths\":[\"Proficient in core frontend technologies: HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript.\",\"Experience with PHP and MySQL, relevant for full-stack development.\",\"Demonstrated project experience (Mouse Master Inventory System) involving frontend development (CSS/JavaScript) and backend integration (PHP, MySQL).\",\"Familiarity with version control (Git/GitHub) and development tools (VS Code, NetBeans).\",\"Strong academic foundation in relevant areas like programming logic and web application development.\"],\"weaknesses\":[\"Limited professional experience specifically as a Frontend Developer; experience is primarily academic/project-based.\",\"No mention of modern frontend frameworks or libraries (e.g., React, Angular, Vue.js) which are highly sought after.\",\"Focus on PHP and Java might indicate a stronger backend inclination than pure frontend.\"],\"suggestions\":[\"Highlight specific frontend contributions and challenges overcome in the 'Mouse Master Inventory System' project.\",\"Consider adding personal projects or contributions to open-source projects that showcase modern frontend skills (e.g., using React, Vue, or Angular).\",\"Emphasize any UI/UX design principles or best practices learned and applied.\",\"Quantify achievements in projects where possible (e.g., 'improved search speed by X%').\"]},\"questions\":{\"questions\":[\"Your CV highlights experience with PHP, MySQL, and JavaScript for the Mouse Master Inventory System. Can you elaborate on a specific technical challenge you faced during its development and how you overcame it?\",\"As a Lead Developer on the Mouse Master Inventory System, how did you approach managing tasks and ensuring collaboration within your team, even if it was an academic project?\",\"You mention a focus on 'data communication' and 'computer networking' in your education. How do you see these skills translating into effective frontend development practices?\",\"Beyond the Mouse Master Inventory System, what other types of web applications or features are you interested in building with your frontend skills?\",\"The digital technology landscape is constantly evolving. How do you stay updated with the latest frontend trends, tools, and best practices?\"]}}"]}
