{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1787206738101,"level":"log","data":["BACKEND RAW RESPONSE =","{\"success\":true,\"cv_id\":\"53147494-3bc8-4686-837d-e1dd3106e5d6\",\"is_passed\":false,\"position\":\"Frontend Developer\",\"analysis\":{\"score\":0,\"status\":\"Rejected\",\"strengths\":[\"Enthusiastic about sports\"],\"weaknesses\":[\"No relevant technical skills for frontend development\",\"Lack of professional experience\",\"Poor academic performance (GPA 2.12, failed a course)\",\"Unprofessional communication (email address, stated willingness to be late)\",\"Skills listed are not applicable to a frontend developer role\",\"Work experience is not relevant and shows poor performance\"],\"suggestions\":[\"Consider a career path more aligned with sports or physical activities.\",\"If interested in frontend development, pursue formal education or training in relevant technologies (HTML, CSS, JavaScript, frameworks).\",\"Develop a professional email address.\",\"Focus on acquiring and demonstrating technical skills relevant to the desired job.\",\"Gain practical experience through personal projects or internships.\"]},\"questions\":{\"questions\":[\"Given your background in Sports Science and your stated passion for sports, how do you see your skills translating to a Frontend Developer role, and what specifically about frontend development interests you?\",\"Your CV mentions a tendency to be late due to watching late-night football. How would you ensure punctuality and commitment to your work schedule as a Frontend Developer, especially considering the collaborative nature of software development?\",\"You've listed skills like 'เตะบอลเก่งมาก' (very good at kicking a ball) and 'เชี่ยวชาญการเล่นวิ่งเปี้ยว' (expert at playing tag). While these demonstrate enthusiasm, how would you apply a problem-solving mindset and technical skills to actual frontend development tasks?\",\"Your experience as a football team captain involved managing a team that lost 5 consecutive matches but received a spirit award. Can you describe a situation where you faced a significant challenge or failure in a team setting and what you learned from it that could be applied to a development project?\",\"The CV highlights a GPA of 2.12 and an 'F' in Nutrition due to excessive 'หมูกระทะ' (BBQ pork). How do you approach learning new technical skills and ensuring you meet the required standards and deadlines in a professional development environment?\"]}}"]}
{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1787206759223,"level":"log","data":["BACKEND RAW RESPONSE =","{\"success\":true,\"cv_id\":\"a516dc65-fd7f-4f97-ad49-3e24b408f800\",\"is_passed\":true,\"position\":\"Full Stack Developer\",\"analysis\":{\"score\":78,\"status\":\"Strong Match\",\"strengths\":[\"Demonstrated full-stack development experience with PHP, MySQL, and JavaScript in the 'Mouse Master Inventory System' project.\",\"Proficiency in core web development technologies including HTML5, CSS3, and SQL.\",\"Familiarity with development tools and environments such as Git/GitHub, VS Code, NetBeans, and Linux.\",\"Experience with database management using MySQL and phpMyAdmin.\",\"Strong academic foundation in programming logic and data communication relevant to software development.\"],\"weaknesses\":[\"The candidate is currently a student, indicating limited professional work experience in a full-time capacity.\",\"While Java is listed, its application in projects is not detailed.\",\"The CV focuses heavily on academic projects, with no mention of professional internships or prior employment in a development role.\"],\"suggestions\":[\"Highlight any professional internships or part-time roles related to software development.\",\"Provide more detail on specific contributions and challenges overcome in the 'Mouse Master Inventory System' project.\",\"Elaborate on any Java projects or experiences, if applicable.\",\"Quantify achievements in projects where possible (e.g., performance improvements, user numbers).\"]},\"questions\":{\"questions\":[\"Can you elaborate on your experience with PHP and MySQL in the Mouse Master Inventory System project? Specifically, what challenges did you face in designing the relational database schema and how did you ensure data integrity?\",\"You mentioned implementing secure session management. Could you describe the approach you took for login/logout functionality and any security considerations you kept in mind?\",\"Beyond PHP and MySQL, you have listed Java as a skill. Can you describe a project where you utilized Java and how it differed from your web development experience?\",\"Your CV highlights a passion for building efficient web solutions. What does 'efficient' mean to you in the context of web development, and how do you strive to achieve it?\",\"As a Lead Developer on the Mouse Master Inventory System, how did you approach collaboration with other team members (if any) and manage the project's development lifecycle?\"]}}"]}
{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1787207322128,"level":"log","data":["BACKEND RAW RESPONSE =","{\"success\":true,\"cv_id\":\"654f161d-3292-42de-91f4-7cc7e34bba6a\",\"is_passed\":true,\"position\":\"Data Analyst\",\"analysis\":{\"score\":78,\"status\":\"Strong Match\",\"strengths\":[\"Proficient in SQL and Python, key skills for a Data Analyst.\",\"Experience with database management and data visualization tools.\",\"Demonstrated ability to develop systems and optimize database interactions through the 'Mouse Master Warehouse System' project.\",\"Strong foundation in computer programming and web development, which can be leveraged for data analysis tasks.\",\"Advanced Excel skills are valuable for data manipulation and analysis.\"],\"weaknesses\":[\"Python proficiency is listed as 'Basic/Intermediate', which might require further development for complex data analysis.\",\"Specific data visualization tools are not explicitly named.\",\"The CV lacks specific examples of data analysis projects or quantifiable achievements in data insights.\",\"The 'Concepts' section includes 'Data Networking' and 'Logic Programming' which are less directly relevant to core data analysis responsibilities compared to statistical modeling or machine learning.\"],\"suggestions\":[\"Quantify achievements in the 'Mouse Master Warehouse System' project, if possible (e.g., 'reduced data retrieval time by X%', 'improved inventory accuracy by Y%').\",\"Elaborate on specific data visualization tools used and provide examples of dashboards or reports created.\",\"Highlight any specific data analysis techniques or methodologies employed in past projects or academic work.\",\"Consider adding any experience with statistical analysis, machine learning concepts, or specific data analysis libraries in Python (e.g., Pandas, NumPy, Scikit-learn) to strengthen the profile.\",\"Include details about the specific type of data analyzed and the business problems solved.\"]},\"questions\":{\"questions\":[\"Your CV mentions proficiency in SQL, Python, and data visualization tools. Can you describe a specific project where you utilized these skills to extract meaningful insights from a dataset and how those insights influenced a business decision?\",\"You have experience in web development, specifically with the Mouse Master Warehouse System. How do you see your web development background complementing your role as a Data Analyst, particularly in terms of data presentation or user interaction with data?\",\"Given your background in Digital Solutions and Technology, how do you approach learning new programming languages or data analysis tools that might be required for a specific project?\",\"Your professional summary highlights a passion for transforming raw data into actionable business insights. Can you elaborate on what 'actionable insights' means to you and provide an example of how you would ensure the insights you provide are truly actionable for stakeholders?\",\"You've listed 'Data Networking' and 'Logic Programming' as concepts you're familiar with. How do you envision these concepts being applied in a practical Data Analyst role, and can you give an example of how understanding data networking might help you in analyzing data?\"]}}"]}
{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1787207647911,"level":"log","data":["BACKEND RAW RESPONSE =","{\"success\":true,\"cv_id\":\"54ccbfda-5011-4638-b879-39643fd18d0e\",\"is_passed\":true,\"position\":\"Frontend Developer\",\"analysis\":{\"score\":55,\"status\":\"Qualified\",\"strengths\":[\"Experience in web development mentioned in the summary.\",\"Developed a web-based inventory management system.\",\"Experience with database interactions and user interface optimization.\",\"Proficient in SQL and Python, which are relevant to frontend development.\",\"Background in computer programming.\"],\"weaknesses\":[\"Primary focus and stated aspiration is Data Analyst, not Frontend Developer.\",\"No specific mention of frontend technologies like HTML, CSS, JavaScript, or frameworks (React, Angular, Vue).\",\"Skills list includes Java and PHP, which are backend languages, and Python/SQL which can be used for both.\",\"Project description focuses on database and UI optimization, not frontend features.\",\"Education is in Digital Solutions and Technology, which is broad and doesn't guarantee frontend specialization.\"],\"suggestions\":[\"Highlight any specific frontend technologies (HTML, CSS, JavaScript, frameworks) used in projects, even if not explicitly listed.\",\"Reframe the professional summary to emphasize interest and experience in Frontend Development.\",\"Include a dedicated section for Frontend Skills, listing relevant languages and frameworks.\",\"Elaborate on the 'user interface' aspects of the Mouse Master Warehouse System project, detailing the frontend components and user experience improvements.\",\"Consider taking courses or completing personal projects specifically focused on modern frontend development to strengthen the profile.\"]},\"questions\":{\"questions\":[\"Your CV lists 'Frontend Developer' as the selected job position, but your experience and skills are primarily focused on Data Analysis. Can you elaborate on your interest in a Frontend Developer role and how your background in computer programming and web development aligns with this position?\",\"You mentioned proficiency in Java, PHP, and Python. While these can be used in frontend development, could you describe your experience with specific frontend technologies like JavaScript, HTML, CSS, and any modern frameworks such as React, Angular, or Vue.js?\",\"Your 'Mouse Master Warehouse System' project involved developing a web-based inventory management system. Can you detail your specific contributions to the user interface and user experience aspects of this project, and what frontend challenges you encountered and overcame?\",\"As a Data Analyst, you're skilled in transforming data into insights. How do you envision applying this analytical mindset to frontend development, perhaps in terms of user behavior analysis, A/B testing for UI improvements, or performance optimization?\",\"Given your background, what are your expectations regarding the balance between data-centric tasks and pure frontend development in this role at TonYourTires, and how do you see yourself contributing to both areas?\"]}}"]}
