{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1787207956529,"level":"log","data":["BACKEND RAW RESPONSE =","{\"success\":true,\"cv_id\":\"4c10e3f4-e862-4196-be78-2b3e30c557cb\",\"is_passed\":true,\"position\":\"Frontend Developer\",\"analysis\":{\"score\":55,\"status\":\"Qualified\",\"strengths\":[\"Experience in web development (Mouse Master Warehouse System)\",\"Proficiency in PHP, which can be relevant for some frontend tasks\",\"Understanding of database interactions and UI optimization\"],\"weaknesses\":[\"Primary experience and stated aspiration is in Data Analysis, not Frontend Development\",\"Limited explicit mention of core frontend technologies (HTML, CSS, JavaScript frameworks like React, Angular, Vue)\",\"Programming skills listed as 'Basic/Intermediate' for Python, and no specific mention of frontend languages\",\"No specific frontend projects or portfolio highlighted\"],\"suggestions\":[\"Highlight any specific frontend technologies used in the 'Mouse Master Warehouse System' project, even if not the primary focus.\",\"Elaborate on the 'user interface' optimization in the project description to showcase frontend skills.\",\"If any personal projects or contributions to open-source frontend projects exist, they should be added.\",\"Consider taking courses or building small projects specifically in HTML, CSS, and JavaScript to strengthen the profile for frontend roles.\"]},\"questions\":{\"questions\":[\"Your CV lists 'Frontend Developer' as the selected job position, but your professional summary and skills highlight Data Analysis. Can you elaborate on your interest in Frontend Development and how your background in Data Analysis might be relevant to this role?\",\"You mentioned developing a web-based inventory management system. Could you describe the specific frontend technologies and frameworks you utilized for the user interface and user experience in that project?\",\"Given your proficiency in SQL and database management, how do you envision integrating frontend applications with backend data sources and APIs in a typical web development workflow?\",\"Your skills mention Java and PHP. While these can be used for frontend development in certain contexts (like Java applets or server-side rendering with PHP), how have you applied these languages specifically to client-side interactivity and user interface creation?\",\"As a Frontend Developer, understanding user needs and translating them into intuitive interfaces is crucial. Can you provide an example of a time you had to gather requirements or understand user pain points and how that influenced your design or development decisions?\"]}}"]}
