{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1787208482232,"level":"log","data":["BACKEND RAW RESPONSE =","{\"success\":true,\"cv_id\":\"5c31e505-a05b-4e8b-9613-79db34ef3c04\",\"is_passed\":false,\"position\":\"Frontend Developer\",\"analysis\":{\"score\":0,\"status\":\"Rejected\",\"strengths\":[\"Enthusiastic about sports\"],\"weaknesses\":[\"No relevant technical skills for frontend development\",\"Lack of professional experience\",\"Poor academic performance (GPA 2.12, failed a course)\",\"Unprofessional communication (email address, stated willingness to be late)\",\"Skills listed are not applicable to a frontend developer role\",\"Work experience is not relevant and shows poor performance\"],\"suggestions\":[\"Consider a career path more aligned with sports or physical activities.\",\"If interested in frontend development, pursue formal education or training in relevant technologies (HTML, CSS, JavaScript, frameworks).\",\"Develop a professional email address.\",\"Focus on acquiring and demonstrating technical skills relevant to the desired job.\",\"Gain practical experience through personal projects or internships.\"]},\"questions\":{\"questions\":[\"Although your degree is in Sports Science, you've applied for a Frontend Developer role. Can you explain your interest in frontend development and how you see your skills translating to this field?\",\"Your CV mentions a GPA of 2.12 and failing a Nutrition course due to excessive 'Moo Krata' consumption. How do you plan to ensure you meet the academic and performance expectations of a professional role, especially considering potential challenges with time management or focus?\",\"You've listed skills like 'expert in playing hopscotch' and 'can kick 180 degrees'. While impressive, how do you believe these unique abilities, or your general athletic background, could be beneficial in a frontend development environment?\",\"As a former team captain who experienced a 5-game losing streak, what strategies did you employ to maintain team morale, and how would you apply similar leadership or motivational skills in a professional development team, especially when facing project challenges or setbacks?\",\"Your CV humorously notes that you might be late sometimes due to watching late-night football and that you 'sleep anywhere'. How would you ensure punctuality and maintain focus and productivity in a professional office setting, and what steps would you take to mitigate any potential disruptions caused by your stated habits?\"]}}"]}
{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1787208534973,"level":"log","data":["BACKEND RAW RESPONSE =","{\"success\":true,\"cv_id\":\"e7d6c965-f96c-4408-98df-9c6cbad92bb4\",\"is_passed\":true,\"position\":\"Backend Developer\",\"analysis\":{\"score\":55,\"status\":\"Qualified\",\"strengths\":[\"Familiarity with programming languages like Java and Python, which are relevant to backend development.\",\"Experience with SQL and database management, a core requirement for backend roles.\",\"Project experience in developing a web-based system (Mouse Master Warehouse System) which involved database optimization and UI.\",\"Understanding of system optimization concepts.\"],\"weaknesses\":[\"The candidate's primary stated role is 'Data Analyst', not 'Backend Developer'.\",\"Programming skills are listed as 'Basic/Intermediate' for Python and Java, which might not be sufficient for a dedicated backend role.\",\"Lack of specific backend technologies mentioned (e.g., frameworks like Spring, Django, Node.js, RESTful APIs, microservices, cloud platforms).\",\"Project description focuses on inventory management and UI, with less emphasis on backend architecture or API development.\"],\"suggestions\":[\"Highlight specific backend projects or contributions in future applications.\",\"Emphasize advanced proficiency in Java or Python, and mention any backend frameworks used.\",\"Detail experience with API design and implementation, server-side logic, and database schema design.\",\"Consider pursuing certifications or further training in backend development technologies.\"]},\"questions\":{\"questions\":[\"Your CV lists 'Data Analyst' as your current role, but you're applying for a Backend Developer position. Can you elaborate on your transition and why you believe your skills are transferable?\",\"You mentioned proficiency in Java, PHP, SQL, and Python. Could you describe a specific project where you utilized these languages to build or optimize backend systems, and what challenges you faced?\",\"The 'Mouse Master Warehouse System' project involved optimizing database interactions. Can you detail the specific database technologies you used and the techniques you employed for optimization?\",\"As a Data Analyst, you've likely worked with data extensively. How do you see your experience in data analysis and database management contributing to effective backend development, particularly in terms of data integrity and performance?\",\"Given your background in Digital Solutions and Technology, what are your thoughts on system architecture and scalability in backend development, and how would you approach designing a robust system?\"]}}"]}
{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1787208638212,"level":"log","data":["BACKEND RAW RESPONSE =","{\"success\":true,\"cv_id\":\"bcaa4c31-5a59-41e2-aa93-b71fc2dd0b74\",\"is_passed\":true,\"position\":\"Frontend Developer\",\"analysis\":{\"score\":65,\"status\":\"Moderate Match\",\"strengths\":[\"Proficient in core frontend technologies like HTML5, CSS3, and JavaScript.\",\"Experience with PHP and MySQL, which are relevant for full-stack development.\",\"Demonstrated ability to build a full-stack inventory management system (Mouse Master Inventory System) using relevant technologies.\",\"Experience with Git/GitHub for version control.\",\"Strong academic background in Digital Solutions and Technology with a focus on programming logic and web application development.\"],\"weaknesses\":[\"Limited explicit mention of modern frontend frameworks or libraries (e.g., React, Angular, Vue.js).\",\"Experience seems primarily focused on backend (PHP) and database aspects, with less emphasis on advanced frontend UI/UX design or complex JavaScript interactions.\",\"The 'Mouse Master Inventory System' project, while full-stack, might not showcase advanced frontend complexities expected in a dedicated Frontend Developer role.\",\"The CV is from a student, indicating limited professional experience in a corporate frontend development environment.\"],\"suggestions\":[\"Highlight any specific frontend-focused aspects or challenges overcome in the 'Mouse Master Inventory System' project.\",\"If the candidate has personal projects or contributions that showcase advanced JavaScript, animations, or responsive design, these should be added.\",\"Consider adding any experience with frontend build tools (e.g., Webpack, Vite) or CSS preprocessors (e.g., Sass, Less).\",\"Emphasize any UI/UX design principles or best practices learned and applied.\",\"If possible, include links to live demos or more detailed project descriptions on GitHub.\"]},\"questions\":{\"questions\":[\"Your CV highlights experience with PHP, Java, and database management. Can you elaborate on your experience with JavaScript, HTML5, and CSS3, specifically in the context of building user interfaces for web applications?\",\"The 'Mouse Master Inventory System' project mentions using CSS/JavaScript for real-time product search. Could you describe the specific JavaScript techniques or libraries you employed to achieve this optimization and what challenges you encountered?\",\"You've listed Git/GitHub as a tool. Can you walk me through your typical Git workflow when collaborating on a project, and how you handle merge conflicts?\",\"Given your background in building an inventory management system, how would you approach designing the frontend for a new e-commerce platform, considering aspects like product display, user cart, and checkout process?\",\"You are a student focusing on Digital Solutions and Technology. How do you stay updated with the latest trends and best practices in frontend development, and how do you apply this learning to your projects?\"]}}"]}
