{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1787209006775,"level":"log","data":["BACKEND RAW RESPONSE =","{\"success\":true,\"cv_id\":\"64f2dff3-270e-446a-bf5a-715fe16dcf87\",\"is_passed\":true,\"position\":\"Frontend Developer\",\"analysis\":{\"score\":78,\"status\":\"Strong Match\",\"strengths\":[\"Proficient in core frontend technologies: HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript.\",\"Experience with PHP and MySQL, relevant for full-stack development.\",\"Demonstrated project experience (Mouse Master Inventory System) involving frontend development (CSS/JavaScript) and backend integration (PHP, MySQL).\",\"Familiarity with version control (Git/GitHub) and development tools (VS Code, NetBeans).\",\"Strong academic foundation in relevant areas like programming logic and web application development.\"],\"weaknesses\":[\"Limited professional experience specifically as a Frontend Developer; experience is primarily academic/project-based.\",\"No mention of modern frontend frameworks or libraries (e.g., React, Angular, Vue.js) which are highly sought after.\",\"Focus on PHP and Java might indicate a stronger backend inclination than pure frontend.\"],\"suggestions\":[\"Highlight specific frontend contributions and challenges overcome in the 'Mouse Master Inventory System' project.\",\"Consider adding personal projects or contributions to open-source projects that showcase modern frontend skills (e.g., using React, Vue, or Angular).\",\"Emphasize any UI/UX design principles or best practices learned and applied.\",\"Quantify achievements in projects where possible (e.g., 'improved search speed by X%').\"]},\"questions\":{\"questions\":[\"Your CV highlights experience with PHP, MySQL, and JavaScript for the Mouse Master Inventory System. Can you elaborate on a specific technical challenge you faced during its development and how you overcame it?\",\"As a Lead Developer on the Mouse Master Inventory System, how did you approach managing tasks and ensuring collaboration within your team, even if it was an academic project?\",\"You mention a focus on 'data communication' and 'computer networking' in your education. How do you see these skills translating into effective frontend development practices?\",\"Beyond the Mouse Master Inventory System, what other types of web applications or features are you interested in building with your frontend skills?\",\"The digital technology landscape is constantly evolving. How do you stay updated with the latest frontend trends, tools, and best practices?\"]}}"]}
{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1787209069765,"level":"log","data":["BACKEND RAW RESPONSE =","{\"success\":true,\"cv_id\":\"81829e4e-6abc-4a28-8509-46c347e50512\",\"is_passed\":true,\"position\":\"Mobile Developer\",\"analysis\":{\"score\":78,\"status\":\"Strong Match\",\"strengths\":[\"Proficient in core mobile development languages like Java and JavaScript.\",\"Hands-on experience with web application development using PHP, which is relevant for backend services.\",\"Demonstrated ability to design and implement a full-stack system (Mouse Master Inventory System) using relevant technologies (PHP, MySQL, JavaScript).\",\"Experience with version control using Git/GitHub.\",\"Familiarity with database management (MySQL).\",\"Currently pursuing a degree in Digital Solutions and Technology, indicating a strong foundational understanding of relevant concepts.\"],\"weaknesses\":[\"No explicit mention of mobile-specific frameworks (e.g., Android SDK, iOS SDK, React Native, Flutter).\",\"Project experience is primarily web-focused, not mobile-specific.\",\"Limited professional experience, as the CV highlights academic projects.\"],\"suggestions\":[\"Highlight any mobile development coursework or personal projects, even if small.\",\"Consider adding a section for mobile development tools and frameworks if any exposure exists.\",\"Emphasize transferable skills from web development to mobile development, such as logic design, database interaction, and API integration.\",\"If possible, create a small personal mobile app project to showcase mobile development capabilities.\"]},\"questions\":{\"questions\":[\"Your CV highlights experience with PHP, Java, and JavaScript. Can you describe a specific mobile application feature you've developed using these languages, or how you would adapt your web development experience to a mobile context?\",\"The 'Mouse Master Inventory System' project involved full-stack development. Could you elaborate on the challenges you faced in designing the database schema for inventory tracking and how you ensured data integrity?\",\"You mention a passion for building efficient web solutions. What strategies do you employ to optimize performance and ensure a smooth user experience, particularly in a mobile environment where resources can be limited?\",\"Collaboration is listed as a core competency. Can you share an example of a challenging team project and how you contributed to its successful completion, especially in a development setting?\",\"As an aspiring developer, what are your thoughts on the current trends and future directions in mobile development, and how do you stay updated with new technologies and best practices?\"]}}"]}
{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1787209650040,"level":"log","data":["BACKEND RAW RESPONSE =","{\"success\":true,\"cv_id\":\"e3aafac9-dcd4-4e75-9261-caf5dff067da\",\"is_passed\":true,\"position\":\"Frontend Developer\",\"analysis\":{\"score\":55,\"status\":\"Qualified\",\"strengths\":[\"Experience in web development mentioned in the summary.\",\"Developed a web-based inventory management system.\",\"Experience with database interactions and user interface optimization.\",\"Proficient in SQL and Python, which are relevant to frontend development.\",\"Background in computer programming.\"],\"weaknesses\":[\"Primary focus and stated aspiration is Data Analyst, not Frontend Developer.\",\"No specific mention of frontend technologies like HTML, CSS, JavaScript, or frameworks (React, Angular, Vue).\",\"Skills list includes Java and PHP, which are backend languages, and Python/SQL which can be used for both.\",\"Project description focuses on database and UI optimization, not frontend features.\",\"Education is in Digital Solutions and Technology, which is broad and doesn't guarantee frontend specialization.\"],\"suggestions\":[\"Highlight any specific frontend technologies (HTML, CSS, JavaScript, frameworks) used in projects, even if not explicitly listed.\",\"Reframe the professional summary to emphasize interest and experience in Frontend Development.\",\"Include a dedicated section for Frontend Skills, listing relevant languages and frameworks.\",\"Elaborate on the 'user interface' aspects of the Mouse Master Warehouse System project, detailing the frontend components and user experience improvements.\",\"Consider taking courses or completing personal projects specifically focused on modern frontend development to strengthen the profile.\"]},\"questions\":{\"questions\":[\"Your CV lists 'Frontend Developer' as the selected job position, but your experience and skills are primarily focused on Data Analysis. Can you elaborate on your interest in a Frontend Developer role and how your background in computer programming and web development aligns with this position?\",\"You mentioned proficiency in Java, PHP, and Python. While these can be used in frontend development, could you describe your experience with specific frontend technologies like JavaScript, HTML, CSS, and any modern frameworks such as React, Angular, or Vue.js?\",\"Your 'Mouse Master Warehouse System' project involved developing a web-based inventory management system. Can you detail your specific contributions to the user interface and user experience aspects of this project, and what frontend challenges you encountered and overcame?\",\"As a Data Analyst, you're skilled in transforming data into insights. How do you envision applying this analytical mindset to frontend development, perhaps in terms of user behavior analysis, A/B testing for UI improvements, or performance optimization?\",\"Given your background, what are your expectations regarding the balance between data-centric tasks and pure frontend development in this role at TonYourTires, and how do you see yourself contributing to both areas?\"]}}"]}
